<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.860 from 1.854 per dlr in.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.860 from 1.854 per dlr in.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.860 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.854 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 11	  November 6</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.860		  1.854</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $13.030 million	  $11.650 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
